  "properties": {
    "title": "OSGeo - Looking Ahead",
    "description": "The session will be featuring the three keynote speakers together with OSGeo President Jeroen Ticheler and several current OSGeo leaders and contributors.\n\nThe panel will explore the future of OSGeo, the challenges and opportunities facing open source geospatial communities, and the role OSGeo can play in the years to come.\r\n\r\nAs we celebrate the 20th anniversary of the OSGeo Foundation in 2026, let us learn from our history, express our gratitude to those who built our community, and look ahead together toward its future.\r\n\r\nThis will be an interactive session \u2014 we welcome your questions and your ideas for OSGeo's next 20 years.",
